{
  "format": "zylab.notebook.v1",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "空气动力学：翼型与标准大气",
    "description": "NACA 翼型几何、国际标准大气温度、薄翼理论升力系数与空气阻力，含公式与曲线。",
    "created": "2026-09-10T14:40:00",
    "modified": "2026-09-10T14:40:00"
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "ca0d0c69e7354bcdb69bce4ec03f2fb1",
      "source": "# NACA 4 位数翼型几何\n# 厚度分布: y_t = (t/0.2)·c·[0.2969√(x/c) - 0.1260(x/c) - 0.3516(x/c)² + 0.2843(x/c)³ - 0.1015(x/c)⁴]\n# 中弧线: 前段 y_c = (m/p²)(2p(x/c)-(x/c)²)，后段 y_c = (m/(1-p)²)((1-2p)+2p(x/c)-(x/c)²)\n# 示例 NACA 2412：m=0.02, p=0.4, t=0.12\nc = 1.0\nm, p, t = 0.02, 0.4, 0.12\nx = linspace(0, c, 400)\n\nyc = np.where(\n    x < p * c,\n    m / p ** 2 * (2 * p * (x / c) - (x / c) ** 2),\n    m / (1 - p) ** 2 * ((1 - 2 * p) + 2 * p * (x / c) - (x / c) ** 2),\n)\nyt = (t / 0.2) * c * (\n    0.2969 * sqrt(x / c) - 0.1260 * (x / c) - 0.3516 * (x / c) ** 2\n    + 0.2843 * (x / c) ** 3 - 0.1015 * (x / c) ** 4\n)\ntheta = np.arctan(np.gradient(yc, x))\n\nxu = x - yt * np.sin(theta)\nyu = yc + yt * np.cos(theta)\nxl = x + yt * np.sin(theta)\nyl = yc - yt * np.cos(theta)\n\nplot(xu, yu, title=\"NACA 2412 翼型几何\", xlabel=\"x/c\", ylabel=\"y/c\", label=\"上表面\")\nplot(xl, yl, label=\"下表面\")\nplot(x, yc, label=\"中弧线\")\n",
      "execution_count": 1,
      "outputs": [
